# The applier quarantines an entry on its first failure.
MODULE: ParkOnlyAfterRepeatedFailureParksFirst
TARGET: ParkOnlyAfterRepeatedFailure
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: the first failed attempt parks the entry
PERTURBS: Settle

--- FIND
    /\ IF fails[cur] + 1 < MaxFailures
--- REPLACE
    /\ IF fails[cur] + 1 < 1
--- END